---
import Player from './Player.astro';
---

<section class="intro">
  <div class="intro-inner">
    <div class="icons icons-left">
      <Player type="man" size={120} />
      <Player type="man" size={84} />
    </div>

    <div class="text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Fußball</p>
      <h1>Unsere Herren</h1>
      <span class="divider" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <p>
        Drei Mannschaften, ein Verein, eine Leidenschaft: Bei uns zählt, was
        auf dem Platz passiert, und was drumherum entsteht. Ob ehrgeiziger
        Kampf um die Punkte oder entspannter Kick nach der Arbeit,
        Einsatz, Teamgeist und Spaß am Spiel stehen bei uns an erster Stelle.
      </p>
      <p>
        Egal ob du schon lange dabei bist, neu in Heidelberg oder nach einer
        Pause zurück am Ball: Komm einfach zum Training vorbei und lerne uns
        kennen!
      </p>

      <div class="contact">
        <span class="contact-label">Kontakt</span>
        <a href="mailto:herren.fussball@heidelberger-sc.de">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2" />
            <path d="M3 7l9 6 9-6" />
          </svg>
          herren.fussball@heidelberger-sc.de
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="icons icons-right">
      <Player type="man" size={120} />
      <Player type="man" size={84} />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .intro {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #000;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
  }
  .intro::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    width: 460px;
    height: 460px;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    border: 2px solid rgba(252, 254, 88, 0.12);
    border-radius: 50%;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .intro::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: rgba(252, 254, 88, 0.12);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .intro-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(0, 640px) 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .icons {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    color: #fcfe58;
  }
  .icons-left :global(.player:nth-child(2)) { transform: translateX(-30px); }
  .icons-right :global(.player:nth-child(2)) { transform: translateX(30px); }
  .icons :global(.player) { transition: transform 0.3s ease; }
  .icons :global(.player:hover) { transform: scale(1.1) rotate(-4deg); }

  .text { text-align: center; }
  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    color: #fcfe58;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #fcfe58;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }
  .divider {
    display: block;
    width: 80px;
    height: 3px;
    margin: 1.5rem auto;
    background: #fcfe58;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .text p:not(.eyebrow) {
    margin: 0 0 1.1rem;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
  }

  .contact {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(252, 254, 88, 0.3);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .contact-label {
    color: #fcfe58;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .contact a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.4rem;
    background: #000;
    color: #fcfe58;
    border: 2px solid #fcfe58;
    border-radius: 999px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .contact a:hover,
  .contact a:focus-visible {
    background: #fcfe58;
    color: #000;
  }
  .contact svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .intro-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .icons {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-end;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
    .icons-left :global(.player:nth-child(2)),
    .icons-right :global(.player:nth-child(2)) { transform: none; }
    .intro::before { width: 320px; height: 320px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .contact a { font-size: 0.85rem; padding: 0.55rem 1rem; }
  }
</style>